            "de": [
              "Beaufsichtigtes Baden im Sommer\r\n\r\nVor dem Baden informieren: https://www.arlysere.fr/loisirs/sport-et-loisirs/plans-deau-naturels/\r\n\r\nAchtung: Nach 18 Uhr erfolgt das Baden auf eigene Gefahr."
            ],
            "en": [
              "Supervised swimming in summer\r\n\r\nBefore swimming, please check: https://www.arlysere.fr/loisirs/sport-et-loisirs/plans-deau-naturels/\r\n\r\nWarning: after 6 p.m., bathing at the user's own risk."
            ],
            "it": [
              "Nuoto supervisionato in estate\r\n\r\nPrima di fare il bagno, controllare: https://www.arlysere.fr/loisirs/sport-et-loisirs/plans-deau-naturels/\r\n\r\nAttenzione: dopo le 18:00 il nuoto è a rischio e pericolo dell'utente."
            ],
            "fr": [
              "Baignade surveillée en été\r\n\r\nAvant la baignade, se renseigner : https://www.arlysere.fr/loisirs/sport-et-loisirs/plans-deau-naturels/\r\n\r\nAttention : après 18h, baignade aux risques et périls des usagers."
            ],
            "nl": [
